THM3889_INDEX all coefficients in (A,C);binary index form represents no unit
THM3889_LEADING split quadratic row discriminant=C^8;one projective infinity point
THM3889_DELTA delta!=0 gives distinct order-3 and order-5 infinity branches
THM3889_GAMMA delta=0,gamma!=0 gives two branches in both eta seams
THM3889_REDUCIBLE delta=gamma=0 forces C|Delta
THM3889_CENSUS1 rows=65536 one_coordinate_lead=5890 primitive_edge=92 coordinate_divisible=92 irreducible_eligible=0
THM3889_CENSUS2 rows=256 two_place=240 reducible=16
THM3889_SCOPE all linear perturbations of normalized split C^8 leading row;other quadratic rows open
